PROTOCOL STANDARDS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

OAR is designed to be compatible with the following open protocol standards:

- Agent-to-Agent Protocol (A2A)       https://a2a-protocol.org
- Model Context Protocol (MCP)        https://modelcontextprotocol.io
- Agent Communication Protocol (ACP)  https://agentprotocol.ai
- Agent Network Protocol (ANP)        https://agent-network-protocol.com

